# 🔥 15. Objects in MERN Applications

Objects are especially important when learning **MERN Stack**.

For example, data received from an API may look like:

```javascript
const user = {
    _id: "101",
    name: "Ajith",
    email: "ajith@example.com",
    skills: ["JavaScript", "React", "Node.js"]
};
```

You can access:

```javascript
console.log(user.name);
console.log(user.skills[0]);
```

Output:

```text
Ajith
JavaScript
```

This kind of object-based data is everywhere in JavaScript applications and APIs.

