# 📊 Object vs Array

| 🧩 Object                      | 📦 Array                     |
| ------------------------------ | ---------------------------- |
| Stores key-value pairs         | Stores ordered elements      |
| Uses keys                      | Uses indexes                 |
| `{ name: "Ajith" }`            | `["Ajith", "Rahul"]`         |
| Access: `user.name`            | Access: `users[0]`           |
| Good for describing one entity | Good for storing collections |

